r Full Professor (Tenured or Tenure Track) Faculty Full time Madison On Site Assistant Professor of Public Policy (Market-Based Solutions to Societal Challenges) Faculty Madison On Site Assistant/Associate Professor in Food and Nutritional Sciences Faculty Full time Madison On Site Assistant Professor (Tenure Track) Faculty Full time Madison On Site Assistant Professor of Philosophy Faculty Full time Madison On Site Assistant Professor in Marketing Faculty Full time Madison On Site Assistant/Associate/Full Professor of Artificial Intelligence for Veterinary Medicine Faculty Full time Madison Hybrid Assistant Professor of Sociology Faculty Madison On Site Displaying 1 - 30 of 39 in total ‹ 1 2 › Help Frequently Asked Questions Disability Accommodations Pay Transparency Policy Statement Footer Crest Quick Links Madison, WI About UW Visit Campus Employee Benefits Working at UW Contact Talent Acquisition Office of Human Resources University of Wisconsin–Madison 21 N. Park Street, Suite 5101 Madison, WI 53715-1218 Website feedback, questions or accessibility issues: ohrwebmaster@ohr.wisc.edu . Learn more about accessibility at UW–Madison . © 2016–2026 Board of Regents of the University of Wisconsin System • Privacy Statement Close Candidate Details We use cookies on this site. By continuing to browse without changing your browser settings to block or delete cookies, you agree to the UW–Madison Privacy Notice . I do not accept I accept"
