      "title": "Student Jobs",
      "description": "Recent Student Jobs at UW–Madison Skip to main content Skip to navigation The university has paused implementation of the COVID-19 vaccine mandate due to an injunction issued by a federal court. UW–Madison employees remain subject to the COVID-19 Workplace Safety Policy . Please visit covidresponse.wisc.edu for more information. Close Student Jobs University of Wisconsin–Madison Job Alerts Applicant Login Job Alerts Applicant Login Filter Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Ok, we will send you jobs like this. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Division/Organization Department Salary/Wage Range or Lump Sum Job Type Closes Part-Time Family Assistant / House Manager (Shorewood Hills) Private Residence $20.00 to $25.00 Local Student Jobs October 05 2026 Shorewood Hills (Near West Madison) family seeks organized Family Assistant. Duties: meal prep, errands, light tidying. Grandmother is home with kids; role is household support + occasionally driving/watching kids (8&5). Must have own car. Workout buddy and driver for 15 year old neurodiverse female Family $18.00 to $30.00 Local Student Jobs October 05 2026 I'm looking for an energetic, fun companion for my very chatty 15 year old to work out and spend time with and occasionally drive her to activities Community Engagement Intern for First-Generation and Limited-Income Services Student Affairs Office of Inclusion Education $16.00 UW Student Jobs September 18 2026 First-Generation and Limited-Income (FGLI) Services is seeking a Community Engagement Intern. Community Engagement Interns work with professional staff to support First-Generation and Limited-Income Services efforts to build community, create opportunities for engagement, and provide resources for first-generation and limited-income students. Facilities and Event Assistant Community Partners Madison Museum of Contemporary Art $17.00-17.50 Local Work Study Student Jobs November 02 2026 The Facilities Assistant supports our Museum by helping with facilities maintenance, event set up and support, and other duties as assigned. Suicide Prevention Graduate Assistant (50% PA) University Health Services Prevention Services $35.98 UW Student Assistant September 20 2026 University Health Services is hiring a Suicide Prevention Graduate Assistant (50% Project Assistant) to join our team! This graduate assistant will work collaboratively with prevention staff to support suicide prevention and mental health promotion initiatives at UW-Madison by delivering presentations to students groups, engaging with campus partners, and providing programmatic and research support in prevention. Student Help - Front Desk General Services Vice Chancellor Finance & Administration $14.68 UW Student Jobs September 25 2026 Serve as the first point of contact for visitors, answer questions, direct customers to appropriate resources, and assist with general office operations for LinkUW at the UW-Madison. Quick Service Restaurant Staff Community Partners The Chowpati $14.00-15.00 Local Work Study Student Jobs November 30 2026 You are the face of our restaurant. Your goal is to provide fast, friendly service while ensuring every meal is prepared to our high standards. You will work in a high-energy environment, rotating between the front counter and kitchen. Office Assistant, Office of Postdoctoral Affairs Graduate School Graduate School Administration $15 - $16 per hour UW Student Jobs September 27 2026 We seek a reliable and detail-oriented student to provide administrative support for programs and services that support postdocs at UW–Madison. This position is ideal for a student looking for part-time work in a professional office environment. We offer a friendly work environment and flexible work schedule. Come join our team! Quality Assurance Intern WiCell $16.00 to $16.00 Local Student Jobs October 04 2026 WiCell seeks a detail-oriented Quality Assurance (QA) Intern to join our QA team! This is a great opportunity to gain work experience in an office environment and collaborate with WiCell staff. WI Union/School of Education Intern: WI Union Theater Wisconsin Union $17.00 to $17.00 UW Student Jobs October 04 2026 Wisconsin Union Theater seeks a community builder! Operational Associate GoPuff Field Operations $14.50 to $14.50 Local Student Jobs October 04 2026 Gopuff is looking for Operations Associates (OAs) to join the operations team. You will accomplish a variety of operations responsibilities including picking, packing and receiving product. Student Help - Pharmacy Professional Master's and Certificate Programs School of Pharmacy Support Services $16-$18 per hour based on experience UW Student Jobs September 06 2026 Join the fun, dynamic team managing the School of Pharmacy's Professional Master's and Certificate Programs! Graduate Project Assistant - Cybersecurity College of Engineering Civil & Environmental Engineering $37417 lump sum UW Student Assistant September 09 2026 Join the UW TOPS Lab as a Graduate Project Assistant and gain hands-on cybersecurity experience supporting real-world systems used by the Wisconsin Department of Transportation (WisDOT) and other partners. This role offers exposure to vulnerability management, infrastructure security, risk assessment, and enterprise security technologies while working directly with the TOPS IT Manager. Ideal for graduate students who are committed to pursuing a cybersecurity career and are eager to apply their knowledge in a production environment. Personal Training Mentee Recreation & Wellbeing Fitness $15.00 UW Student Jobs October 01 2026 Ready to start your career as a Personal Trainer? The Rec Well Mentorship Program offers paid, hands-on experience to help prepare you for employment at Rec Well. Over 10 weeks during the Spring 2027 semester, mentees earn $15/hour while gaining experience in fitness assessments, program design, client training, and more. Enrollment in the ACE Course or an NCCA-accredited personal training certification is required. Gallery Attendant Community Partners Madison Museum of Contemporary Art $17.00 UW Student Jobs October 03 2026 Museum Attendants are essential ambassadors of MMoCA who help fulfill the mission of the Museum by not only helping preserve and protect the artwork, but also by educating our visitors about the Museum, exhibitions, and programs. As knowledgeable and customer service-minded individuals, Museum Attendants welcome and assist museum-goers as they navigate the facilities, communicate MMoCA policies, and offer interpretive assistance for the exhibitions, programs, and other mission-driven initiatives to ensure that all visitors have an enjoyable experience. Middle School Afterschool Assistant Director Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $18.00 to $19.40 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 MSCR offers After School Programs at all 12 MMSD Middle Schools. MSCR Middle School After School programs are geared towards student choice and operate on a “drop-in” model. Youth Soccer Instructor & Referee Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $18.00 to $23.00 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 MSCR Youth Sports Leagues provides participants with an experience that emphasizes skill and character development through non-competitive recreational leagues. Our youth leagues promote fun, participation, sportsmanship and fair play. Adult Basketball League Score Timer Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $17.00 to $18.75 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 MSCR Sports Programming aims to inspire the community to lead active, healthy lives by connecting each other through community leagues, classes and wellness activities. Adult Basketball League Site Supervisor Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $19.00 to $21.10 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 MSCR Sports Programming aims to inspire the community to lead active, healthy lives by connecting each other through community leagues, classes and wellness activities. Recreation Field Supervisor - Arts Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $19.00 to $21.10 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 MSCR's Youth and Adult Arts & Enrichment programs are designed to provide lifelong learning opportunities that are accessible, social, low-pressure, and fun! More Jobs 349 Expression of interest Loading... Current opportunities Position Division/Organization Department Salary/Wage Range or Lump Sum Job Type Closes Part-Time Family Assistant / House Manager (Shorewood Hills) Private Residence $20.00 to $25.00 Local Student Jobs October 05 2026 Part-Time Family Assistant / House Manager (Shorewood Hills) summary: Shorewood Hills (Near West Madison) family seeks organized Family Assistant. Duties: meal prep, errands, light tidying. Grandmother is home with kids; role is household support + occasionally driving/watching kids (8&5). Must have own car. Workout buddy and driver for 15 year old neurodiverse female Family $18.00 to $30.00 Local Student Jobs October 05 2026 Workout buddy and driver for 15 year old neurodiverse female summary: I'm looking for an energetic, fun companion for my very chatty 15 year old to work out and spend time with and occasionally drive her to activities Community Engagement Intern for First-Generation and Limited-Income Services Student Affairs Office of Inclusion Education $16.00 UW Student Jobs September 18 2026 Community Engagement Intern for First-Generation and Limited-Income Services summary: First-Generation and Limited-Income (FGLI) Services is seeking a Community Engagement Intern. Community Engagement Interns work with professional staff to support First-Generation and Limited-Income Services efforts to build community, create opportunities for engagement, and provide resources for first-generation and limited-income students. Facilities and Event Assistant Com