ith an experience that emphasizes skill and character development through non-competitive recreational leagues. Our youth leagues promote fun, participation, sportsmanship and fair play. Adult Basketball League Score Timer Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $17.00 to $18.75 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 Adult Basketball League Score Timer summary: MSCR Sports Programming aims to inspire the community to lead active, healthy lives by connecting each other through community leagues, classes and wellness activities. Adult Basketball League Site Supervisor Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $19.00 to $21.10 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 Adult Basketball League Site Supervisor summary: MSCR Sports Programming aims to inspire the community to lead active, healthy lives by connecting each other through community leagues, classes and wellness activities. Recreation Field Supervisor - Arts Madison School & Community Recreation (MSCR) $19.00 to $21.10 Local Student Jobs October 03 2026 Recreation Field Supervisor - Arts summary: MSCR's Youth and Adult Arts & Enrichment programs are designed to provide lifelong learning opportunities that are accessible, social, low-pressure, and fun! More Jobs 349 Powered by PageUp Clear search filters Remote Eligibility All Remote 13 Not Remote 313 Partially Remote 39 Job Type Local Student Jobs 244 Local Work Study Preferred Student Jobs 2 Local Work Study Student Jobs 29 UW Student Assistant 3 UW Student Jobs 91 Job Categories/ Outcomes Job Categories Agriculture and Natural Resources 29 Athletics, Sports, and Recreation 74 Business Management, Finance, and Marketing 46 Child Development and Care 97 Communications, Broadcasting, and Media Arts 51 Customer Service 119 Data Analysis 22 Department and Office Assistants 33 Education and Training 68 Facilities and Landscaping 23 Federal Work-Study Preferred 35 Government and Public Administration 12 Graduate Assistant-Programs/Projects 7 Graduate Assistant-Research