      "description": "Jobs at UW (@JobsAtUW) / X Log in Sign up Jobs at UW 5,179 posts Jobs at UW @JobsAtUW UW–Madison was named one of America’s Best Large Employers for 2026 in a survey by Forbes. Visit jobs.wisc.edu and #WorkWithBucky Madison, WI jobs.wisc.edu Joined February 2017 284 Following 878 Followers Mention Follow Posts Posts Replies Replies Reposts Reposts Media Media Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Terms · Privacy · Cookies · Accessibility · US TIDA · Ads Info · More © 2026 X Corp. Jobs at UW @JobsAtUW Sep 3 Interested in a career at UW-Madison but have questions?\nConnect with a member of the Work With Bucky team! We can help you navigate the recruitment process and explore opportunities that match your interests.\nLearn more: jobs.wisc.edu/workwithbucky #WorkWithBucky #JobsAtUW 39 Jobs at UW @JobsAtUW Sep 1 Did you know? UW-Madison's job website offers more than job postings. Find application tips, interview guidance, job alerts, featured opportunities, and support from the Work With Bucky team. Learn more: jobs.wisc.edu/applicant-reso… #WorkWithBucky #JobsAtUW 32 Jobs at UW @JobsAtUW Aug 27 UW–Madison seeks an Assistant Public Records Custodian to support compliance efforts and public records program. Learn more and apply: jobs.wisc.edu/jobs/assistant… #WorkWithBucky #Compliance 62 Jobs at UW @JobsAtUW Aug 26 Wondering where your career could take you?\n\nWhether you're looking for a fresh start, a new challenge, or a chance to make an impact, your next opportunity could be waiting at UW-Madison.\n\nExplore open positions at jobs.wisc.edu #WorkWIthBucky #JobsAtUW #UWMadison 54 Jobs at UW @JobsAtUW Aug 21 Eagle’s Wing Child Care & Education Programs is seeking an Assistant Teacher for the Infant/Toddler team. Join a high-quality, play-based learning environment serving children ages 6 weeks to 8 years. jobs.wisc.edu/jobs/early-chi… #WorkWithBucky #TeacherJobs #EarlyChildhoodEducation 1 47"
